nt,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">月之暗面在GTC2026开源三大核心架构：重构优化器、注意力机制与残差连接</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI发布AI时代记分卡，引入“有用智能每美元”衡量ROI</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google DeepMind发布GenCeption模型，基于视频生成技术实现多项视觉任务突破</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">马斯克称xAI旗下2万亿参数大模型即将完成训练，或挑战Kimi K3性能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f522f27f968293bce5fa641ed861e48a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">特斯拉CEO马斯克宣布，其旗下xAI开发的2万亿参数大模型预计将于下周完成初步训练。马斯克表示，该模型整体性能将显著优于此前的1.5万亿参数版本，并有望在性能表现上挑战月之暗面近期发布的Kimi K3。此前，马斯克曾公开评价Kimi K3表现“令人印象深刻”。Kimi K3作为目前全球参数规模最大的开源大模型之一，具备2.8万亿参数、100万词元上下文窗口及原生视觉理解能力，曾在Arena AI前端编程排行榜以1679分位居全球第一。此次xAI公布新模型进展，标志着全球AI厂商在超大规模模型领域的竞争进一步加剧。随着大模型研发进入新阶段，参数规模、推理能力、上下文长度及开源生态已成为行业争夺的核心技术高地。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里发布Token Plan个人版并上线Qwen3.8-Max-Preview模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ceebdfcbec3ff731e17fdaba0c48808e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月19日，阿里正式发布Token Plan个人版，并同步开放Qwen3.8-Max-Preview模型体验。该模型参数规模达2.4万亿，在代码工程与专业办公场景表现突出，正式版预计近期发布并开源。Token Plan个人版提供Lite、Standard、Pro三档套餐，月费分别为39元、139元与499元；团队版则按席位收费。阿里针对该模型推出限时优惠，白天Credits消耗降至1折，个人版用户夜间使用可享折上折。此外，AI编程产品Qoder与QoderWork已首发支持Qwen3.8-Max-Preview，千问PC端用户可免费体验。此次发布旨在通过Token Plan、开发工具及开源策略，加速Qwen系列模型在生产力场景的落地，进一步强化模型能力、成本控制与生态建设的综合竞争力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">月之暗面在GTC2026开源三大核心架构：重构优化器、注意力机制与残差连接</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/771388504ca418bb53c19b1e1546d63c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在GTC2026上，月之暗面CEO杨植麟宣布开源三项重构Transformer基础组件的技术，旨在提升模型训练效率与能力上限。针对优化器，月之暗面推出MuonClip替代Adam，通过独立参数更新提升数据利用率，并配合QK-Clip解决万亿参数下的数值失控问题。针对长上下文，研发Kimi Linear架构，核心KDA机制通过多通道遗忘策略，在百万Token级别实现比全注意力更高的计算效率。针对残差连接，发布Attention Residue架构，允许模型主动从历史计算层挑选信息，在推理与编程任务中带来约24%的Token效率提升。此外，杨植麟还介绍了支持300个Agent并行的Agent Swarm架构及早期融合视觉训练方案。这些组件均已开源，旨在通过底层架构创新应对高质量数据稀缺与算力成本挑战，推动开源模型性</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布AI时代记分卡，引入“有用智能每美元”衡量ROI</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/34e91b0e607a318a17e195c23e79f215.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于7月17日发布AI经济价值评估框架，提出“有用智能每美元”指标，旨在帮助企业跳出单纯的Token成本计算，通过衡量AI完成任务的实际价值与总成本来评估ROI。该框架涵盖四项核心维度：任务完成度、单项成功任务成本、结果可靠性及规模化价值。OpenAI指出，模型性能与成本并非线性关系，高性能模型因减少了重试、人工审核与返工，往往能实现更低的单任务总成本。随文发布的GPT-5.6系列模型即遵循此逻辑，提供Sol、Terra、Luna三个层级，以适配不同经济性的工作流。数据显示，GPT-5.6 Sol在DeepSWE v1.1工程任务中成功率达72.7%，API成本预估降低36.2%。OpenAI强调，企业应通过追踪同一工作流的产出与成本，验证AI投入是否随规模增长实现价值最大化。此举旨在引导行业关注AI</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google DeepMind发布GenCeption模型，基于视频生成技术实现多项视觉任务突破</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9b0d5d43ad449628a8487ebcac6773d3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google DeepMind近日发布GenCeption模型，该模型基于预训练视频生成模型Wan2.1构建，旨在通过单一架构解决深度估计、图像分割、3D姿态估计等经典计算机视觉任务。GenCeption利用视频生成模型在训练中习得的场景结构与运动规律，仅需一次前向传播即可输出深度图、表面法线、分割掩码及姿态估计结果。在数据效率方面，该模型仅使用包含7500个视频的合成数据集进行训练，数据需求量较传统专用模型降低了7至500倍。测试显示，GenCeption在多项基准测试中表现优异，并具备处理真实世界多人场景、动物及人形机器人的泛化能力。目前模型处理81帧视频约需6至10秒，研究团队指出，联合训练多任务可能影响复杂任务性能，且推理速度仍有优化空间。此项研究表明，视频生成模型正逐步向通用视觉理解基础模型演进。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
